                {
                  "id": "p-inspection-req-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Using a consistent semi-trailer inspection checklist helps ensure nothing is overlooked. Even small issues like worn airlines or damaged lights can result in violations during roadside inspections.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-compliance",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Compliance Saves More Than Just Fines",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "compliance"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-compliance-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Many fleets think about DOT compliance only when inspection season comes around. In reality, following DOT trailer regulations delivers benefits year-round.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-compliance-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "<strong>Regular inspections help:</strong>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-compliance-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Reduce unexpected breakdowns"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Prevent expensive emergency repairs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Improve driver safety"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Increase trailer reliability"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Extend equipment lifespan"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Protect your company's reputation"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-compliance-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One missed maintenance issue can take a trailer out of service, delay deliveries, and impact customer relationships. Preventive maintenance is almost always less expensive than emergency repairs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
