                    "text": "Common DOT Violations Fleets Can Avoid",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "violations"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-violations-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Many trailer violations are completely preventable with regular maintenance. Some of the most common issues include:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-violations-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "mark": "bullet",
                    "runIn": true,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Brake Problems:",
                        "text": "Brake violations remain one of the leading reasons commercial vehicles are placed out of service. Worn brake components or improper adjustments should be addressed immediately."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Tire Damage:",
                        "text": "Low tread depth, uneven wear, exposed cords, or improper tire pressure can all create safety concerns."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Lighting Failures:",
                        "text": "Faulty brake lights, marker lights, or turn signals can quickly lead to roadside citations."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Suspension Wear:",
                        "text": "Damaged suspension components affect ride quality, tire wear, and vehicle stability."
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Coupling Issues:",
                        "text": "Fifth wheel connections, kingpins, and safety devices should be inspected regularly to ensure secure trailer attachment."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-violations-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A preventative maintenance schedule helps catch these issues long before they become costly problems.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
