                  "id": "p-pro-service-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Instead of reacting to breakdowns, professional trailer service allows fleets to stay ahead of maintenance and reduce unexpected downtime. At Sun State Trailers, our goal is to help customers spend less time in the shop and more time on the road, delivering dependable service with straightforward communication and a commitment to your success.",
